        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Full day (8–10 hours) or 2-day / 1-night lodge safari</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Abeid Amani Karume International Airport (ZNZ) or hotel lobby for speedboat departure — return transfer included.</p>
